[statement]
A member's own pax header carrying an extended attribute. Every reader reads
the member alike, and ferrotape passes the attribute to the caller.

[archive]
pax SCHILY.xattr.user.k=v
header name=a
data "hello\n"
end

[verdict]
all: read

